{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1060899/block/singleImage/3251878/df/01M62T73K6G0AA0CAWACGB745T.jpg?updatedAt=1793247794\"/><figcaption>佐敦彌敦道192至194號一間餐廳廚房的抽油煙機起火，冒出大量濃煙(Threads)</figcaption></figure><p>佐敦發生火警。今日（29日）早上9時31分，彌敦道192至194號一間餐廳起火，彌敦道近柯士甸道交界冒出大量濃煙，途人紛走避。消防員到場將火救熄。初步調查指，餐廳廚房的抽油煙機起火，員工自行疏散，無人受傷。 運輸署一度宣布，柯士甸道（往紅磡方向）介乎彌敦道與覺士道之間的全線需要封閉；另外彌敦道（往梳士巴利道方向）近柯士甸道的慢線亦需封閉，交通繁忙。</p><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 am730（@am730hk）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T04:41:26.064730+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":258,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T03:11:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T05:20:04.576386+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T04:38:18.931595+00:00","content_hash":"d2c2443fe592ce2f4767c5b3ab71578c866a75509a82092be265764247054323","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T04:41:26.064730+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}